    kg:textSpan "the same RegNetY-128GF architecture. A surprising result is that we observe a stable gain of 2 . 5% in top-1 accuracy, regardless of the fraction of training data available to netune on Places205. The difference between self-supervised and supervised pretraining may be explained by the difference in the nature of training data: features learned from images in the wild may be more suitable to classify scene. Additionally, the non-uniform distribution of underlying concepts in the wild may also pr" .

