    kg:textSpan "= ( s 1 , . . . , s L ) through AntiBERTy. We extract the nal hidden representation from AntiBERTy and reduce the dimensionality using a linear transformation, resulting in a variable-length embedding H = ( h 1 , . . . , h L ) with h i R d emb . Then, we use a multi-head attention [ 18 ] pooling layer to reduce the variable-length embedding to a xed size vector, described below for one attention head: Figure 1: Diagram of MIL model for predicting whether a bag of sequences contains a highly redu" .

