    kg:textSpan "nal version of LaMDA. Rather this is just a recipe for generating \"LaMDAs\" and should be taken as a way to eventually produce production-ready versions for specic applications. 9.1 Examining bias Many fundamental challenges to developing a high quality dialog model capable of performing well in real world applications still exist. For example, it is now increasingly well-understood that large language models trained on unlabeled datasets will learn to imitate patterns and biases inherent in thei" .

