    kg:inPaper <http://example.org/kg/paper/2201_09637_rag> ;
    kg:textSpan "the model to factor simple linear behavior, but also alleviates the memorization of corrupted labels. Similar work following this idea includes label ensemble ( Laine & Aila , 2017 ) and importance re-weighting ( Liu & Tao , 2015 ). From the view of optimization algorithm design, some work ( Han et al. , 2018b ; Li et al. , 2020 ) introduces novel optimization algorithms or schedule strategies to solve the label noise issue. One common approach in this line is to train a single neural network 10" .

