    kg:textSpan "tied input-output token representations ( Press & Wolf , 2017 ). The encoder and decoder have the same width and number of transformer blocks. Figure 1 summarizes the model architecture. We use the same byte-level BPE text tokenizer used in GPT- 2 ( Sennrich et al. , 2015 ; Radford et al. , 2019 ) for the Englishonly models and ret the vocabulary (but keep the same size) for the multilingual models to avoid excessive fragmentation on other languages since the GPT-2 BPE vocabulary is English only" .

