    kg:inPaper <http://example.org/kg/paper/2212_04356_rag> ;
    kg:textSpan "Our analysis is summarized in Figure 8 . With the exception of English speech recognition, performance continues to increase with model size across multilingual speech recognition, speech translation, and language identication. The diminishing returns for English speech recognition could be due to saturation effects from approaching humanlevel performance as analysis in Section 3.9 suggests. 4.2. Dataset Scaling At 680,000 hours of labeled audio, the Whisper dataset is one of the largest ever cr" .

<http://example.org/kg/chunk/2212_06817_rag__chunk_008> a kg:Chunk ;
