    kg:textSpan "Transformer-based controllers (Reed et al., 2022; Lee et al., 2022a). Inference speed. In contrast to many applications of large models, such as natural language or image generation, one of the unique requirements for a model that needs to run on real robots in real time is fast and consistent inference speed. Given the human speeds of executing the instructions 6 considered in this work (which we measured to be in the 2 4 secs range), we want the model to be not significantly slower than that. " .

