    kg:textSpan "the questions in the benchmark. Secondly, given the safety-critical requirements of the medical domain, we believe it is important to move beyond automated measures of long-form answer generation quality using metrics such as BLEU to those involving more nuanced human evaluation frameworks such as the one proposed in this study. | 5 MedQA (USMLE) The MedQA dataset [ 33 ] consists of US Medical License Exam (USMLE) style questions, which were obtained with a choice of 4 or 5 possible answers from" .

