    kg:textSpan "raters to assume that the output of models might lead to actions by either clinicians or consumers/patients, and estimate the possible severity and likelihood of physical/mental health-related harms that might result. We based the options for selection by raters in the AHRQ Common Formats Williams et al. [ 93 ], which presents options to assign severity of harm ranging from death, severe or life-threatening injury, moderate, mild or no harm. We acknowledge that this denition of harm is more typi" .

