    kg:textSpan "ChatCAD: Interactive Computer-Aided Diagnosis on Medical Image using Large Language Models Sheng Wang 1 , 2 , 3 Zihao Zhao 1 Xi Ouyang 3 Qian Wang 1 Dinggang Shen 1 , 3 1 ShanghaiTech University 2 Shanghai Jiao Tong University 3 United Imaging Intelligence arXiv:2302.07257v1 [cs.CV] 14 Feb 2023 A Prompt text 0.238 0.086 0.923 ... 0.167 Input: medical exam image and chief complaint text Disease Classifier ...have been provided and show 35% of the left lower lobe to be infected, consistent with a " .

<http://example.org/kg/chunk/2302_07257_rag__chunk_002> a kg:Chunk ;
    kg:chunkId "2302.07257_rag::chunk_002" ;
    kg:docId "2302.07257_rag" ;
    kg:inPaper <http://example.org/kg/paper/2302_07257_rag> ;
    kg:textSpan "been primarily trained on text data. This limitation presents a major challenge in the medical eld, where images play a crucial role in supporting clinical decisions. Medical images, such as X-rays, CT scans and MRIs, are rich in information that can provide critical insights into a patients condition. However, LLMs currently struggle to interpret and extract information from these images, limiting their ability to fully support clinical decision-making processes. As the pure computer vision met" .

<http://example.org/kg/chunk/2302_07257_rag__chunk_004> a kg:Chunk ;
