    kg:textSpan "or Cyrillic scripts: bg , ca , cs , da , de , en , es , fr , hr , hu , it , nl , pl , pt , ro , ru , sl , sr , sv , uk . We process the data to remove hyperlinks, comments and other formatting boilerplate. English CommonCrawl [67%]. We preprocess ve CommonCrawl dumps, ranging from 2017 to 2020, with the CCNet pipeline ( Wenzek et al. , 2020 ). This process deduplicates the data at the line level, performs language identication with a fastText linear classier to remove non-English pages and lters" .

