    kg:textSpan "specific models with state-of-the-art performance. We next present the key findings of our research, provide an overall view of the report, and review related work. 1.2 Key Findings SoTA results for downstream multilingual speech tasks: Our USM models achieve state-of-the-art performance for multilingual ASR and AST for multiple datasets in multiple domains. This includes SpeechStew (mono-lingual ASR) [2], CORAAL (African American Vernacular English (AAVE) ASR) [17], FLEURS (multi-lingual ASR) [" .

