    kg:textSpan "outputs that we have taken efforts to correct but which will take some time to fully characterize and manage. We aim to make GPT-4 and other systems we build have reasonable default behaviors that reflect a wide swath of users values, allow those systems to be customized within some broad bounds, and get public input on what those bounds should be. See OpenAI [68] for more details. 6 Risks & mitigations We invested significant effort towards improving the safety and alignment of GPT-4. Here we h" .

