    kg:textSpan "specialized datasets drawn from target applications and general methods for steering the behavior of the models, such as reinforcement learning with human feedback (RLHF), which guides the system toward a better understanding of end-users requests [CLB + 17, BJN + 22]. There has also been great interest in the ability of LLMs to make useful inferences for a broad range of specialized tasks without dedicated ne-tuning. The performance of general-purpose LLMs using few- or even zero-shot prompting" .

