    kg:textSpan "medical question answering. Likewise, a robust understanding of how LLM outputs compare to physician answers is a broad, highly signicant question meriting much future work; the results we report here represent one step in this research direction. For our current study, physicians generating answers were prompted to provide useful answers to lay-people but were not provided with specic clinical scenarios or nuanced details of the communication requirements of their audience. While this may be re" .

