    kg:textSpan "al. , 2020 ). In mixed-domain approach, the model initialises with BERT weights and vocabulary trained on general domain text and the model is pretrained on the biomedical text. Biomedical domain with its publicly available literature which is growing exponentially by the year makes it well suited for domain specic pretraining from scratch. Using a general domain vocabulary for biomedical text results in complex and specic terms being split into numerous subwords, as they do not exist in the gen" .

