    kg:textSpan "release the pretrained weights for all our models and the code for reproducibility. The results clearly show that all BioELECTRA models pretrained from scratch with biomedical domain text and domain specic vocabulary perform better than the model pretrained on both general and biomedical domain text with general domain vocabulary. However it is interesting to note that We plan to explore and experiment with our domain specic pretraining approach on ELECTRALARGE models. We also intend to train EL" .

