    kg:textSpan "large-scale pre-training methods such as CLIP ( Radford et al. , 2021 ), ALIGN ( Jia et al. , 2021 ), and Wu Dao 2.0 ( Wud ), which learn directly from Web-scale image-text pairs, show very encouraging progress for efcient transfer learning, and zero-shot capability. However, such models are restricted to image to text mapping only tasks such as classication, retrieval, and tagging. In this paper, we present an emerging paradigm for building a vision foundation model , called Florence . We use t" .

