    kg:textSpan ", 2021 ). For the image encoder, we chose hierarchical Vision Transformers ( e.g. , Swin ( Liu et al. , 2021a ), CvT ( Wu et al. , 2021 ), Vision Longformer ( Zhang et al. , 2021a ), Focal Transformer ( Yang et al. , 2021 ), and CSwin ( Dong et al. , 2021 )). While inheriting performance benets of the transformer self-attention operations ( Dosovitskiy et al. , 2021b ), these hierarchical architectures model the scale invariance nature of images and have linear computational complexity with resp" .

