    kg:textSpan "does patient have that are pertinent to diabetes diagnosis?). For medication-related questions, the GatorTron-large model achieved the best exact match score of 0.3155, outperforming the BioBERT and ClinicalBERT by 6.8% and 7.5%, respectively. For relation-related questions, GatorTron-large also achieved the best exact match score of 0.9301, outperforming BioBERT and ClinicalBERT by 9.5% and 7.77%, respectively. We also observed a monotonic performance improvement by scaling up the size of the G" .

