    kg:textSpan "with each model generation. 5 Calibration We now focus on GPT-4s calibration, a measure of the agreement between the predicted probabilities of each answers correctness and the true frequencies of the outcomes. Calibration of the likelihood of the correctness of answers, or any assertions generated by an LLM, is critical for applications in high-stakes domains like medicine. A well-calibrated model can provide trustworthy and interpretable probabilities that reect the condence of the model. Conv" .

