    kg:textSpan "Curation of HealthSearchQA and MultiMedQA We introduce HealthSearchQA, a dataset of 3375 commonly searched consumer medical questions. We present this dataset alongside six other existing open datasets for medical question answering, spanning medical exam, medical research, and consumer medical questions, as a diverse benchmark to assess the clinical knowledge and question answering capabilities of LLMs (see Section 3.1 ). Pilot framework for human evaluation We pilot a framework for physician a" .

