    kg:textSpan "multimodal dataset (Birhane et al., 2021). In addition, this abstractive approach to data curation leads to corpora that are difficult to meaningfully document and govern after the fact, as the provenance and authorship of individual items is usually lost in the process (although works such as Gao et al. (2020) that prioritize compilations of previously documented individual sources over crawled data provide a step towards addressing these issues (Biderman et al., 2022)). In the context of the B" .

